<title>USA: TABLE - John Alden Financial Corp Q2 results.</title>
<headline>TABLE - John Alden Financial Corp Q2 results.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.74		    $0.50</p>
<p> Net			 19,300		   13,400</p>
<p> Revs		     293,900		  394,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  25,685		   25,689</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
