<p> Revs		     618,200		  803,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  25,661		   25,659</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Revenues are from group premiums only and exclude realized investment gains, investment income and other income.</p>
